WEBVTT

00:10:58.237 --> 00:11:01.699
I didn't have to worry
about trying to find the words

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.575
to tell him all that he'd meant to me

00:11:03.617 --> 00:11:06.245
and only hope that he could
hear what I said.

00:11:06.995 --> 00:11:10.332
Instead, I could be present to his dying.

00:11:10.374 --> 00:11:14.128
I could affirm that if this
was his time to move on,

00:11:14.128 --> 00:11:15.421
that was OK.

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:19.925
I could love him with presence
and with touch,

00:11:19.967 --> 00:11:24.221
knowing full well that my Gracenote
those many years earlier

00:11:24.263 --> 00:11:29.518
had been a sincere and thorough
rendering of his life well lived.